  "railModal.p.ug_also_follows_your": {
   "text": "UG also follows your system settings for reduced motion and contrast, works with a screen reader (landmarks, labels and live regions), is keyboard-navigable end to end, and listens to voice commands through the microphone button or a Cephable profile. Tell us what would help: hello@ug.example.",
